---
// src/components/Interests.astro
---

<div class="interestsCard">
  <div class="card-header">
    <svg class="header-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10H12V2z"/>
      <path d="M12 12L2.5 7.5"/>
      <path d="m12 12 8.5 4.5"/>
    </svg>
    <span class="header-title">Interests</span>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <p class="para">
      Apart from coding, I enjoy making <span class="highlight">'That's what she said'</span> jokes, doomscrolling brainrot (<span class="highlight">Skibidi Toilet</span> being my fav one), reading and writing books occasionally, nerding about <span class="highlight">F1</span>, and playing <span class="highlight">Minecraft</span> a lot.
    </p>

    <p class="para">
      Currently, I'm living in <span class="highlight">New Delhi</span> and my days involve going to work, coming back and building my own projects and trying out new technology.
    </p>

    <p class="disclaimer">
      Feel free to reach out to talk about any of these, but responses can be delayed as I'm mostly busy with my job ;-;
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .interestsCard {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 20, 45, 0.65), rgba(15, 15, 20, 0.85));
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
    border-radius: 24px;
    color: var(--text, #ffffff);
    height: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .interestsCard:hover {
    border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: #c084fc;
  }

  .header-icon {
    width: 1.1rem;
    height: 1.1rem;
  }

  .header-title {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .content {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .para {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: #d8b4fe;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.14);
    padding: 0.05em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 6px;
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
    box-decoration-break: clone;
  }

  .disclaimer {
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: auto; /* anchors to the bottom of the card */
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.18);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
</style>